 "lines": {"rainbow_charm_wipe_the_mist_off_in_one_big_arc": ["Cleared an arc. Looks a bit like effort. It was.", "Mist off. Colours showing. Stripes on parade."], "rainbow_charm_tilt_the_charm_so_the_arch_catches_the_light": ["Caught a stripe. Then another. Then the sun, in the eye.", "Every angle's a different colour. Show-off. I approve."], "rainbow_charm_huff_on_the_pane_and_draw_an_arch_in_the_mist": ["Four arches. Three wonky. One of them's me.", "Drew a rainbow in my own breath. Peak talent."], "rainbow_charm_ring_the_plate_like_a_bell_for_a_change_of_weather": ["Rang for sun. A cloud answered. Weather has a sense of humour.", "Ding. If it's not sunny in ten, I'm filing a complaint."], "rainbow_charm_chase_the_foot_of_the_rainbow_down_the_rail": ["Almost had the end. It moved. Rude. Colourful, but rude.", "Raced it to the stud. Lost. It's a very fast arch."], "rainbow_charm_dig_at_the_foot_of_the_arch_for_a_pot_of_something": ["No pot. Dug a bit. Found rail. Grudge acquired.", "Nothing at the end. The legend is a big liar."], "rainbow_charm_lick_a_stripe_of_the_rail_for_flavour": ["Orange tastes like wood. Possibly. Also like regret.", "Colours have no flavour. Colours are liars."], "rainbow_charm_nap_curled_in_the_colours_at_the_foot_of_the_case": ["Dreamt in colour. Woke up in beige.", "Slept in stripes. Dawn arrived in plain."], "rainbow_charm_sulk_because_the_colours_only_come_after_rain": ["Rain first. Colours second. Typical. Nothing's ever free.", "Sulking in grey. Only the rainbow gets to be fancy."], "rainbow_charm_stretch_both_wings_up_to_match_the_arch_in_the_sky": ["Matched the sky. Better posture. Fewer stripes.", "Held the pose. A cloud stole the light. Typical cloud."], "rainbow_charm_present_the_arch_to_the_empty_sky": ["Behold. Sky: please hold still. It does not.", "Every colour, all at once. You're welcome. Nobody's here."], "rainbow_charm_argue_with_the_arch_about_who_has_more_colours": ["Said I've got six colours. It said it's got seven. Showoff.", "Lost on colours. I'm mostly yellow. Orange. A bit orange."], "rainbow_charm_shout_for_the_sun_to_come_out_and_finish_it": ["Sun, come out. You're half done. We're all watching.", "Bellowed at the sky. Sky said drizzle. Sky's got range."], "rainbow_charm_stand_shoulder_to_shoulder_as_the_two_legs_of_one_arch": ["Two legs, one arch, no pot. Nobody expected a pot.", "Held the arch together. Mine held better. Obviously."], "rainbow_charm_play_tag_round_the_foot_of_the_case": ["Tag. Still it. Been it since morning. It's a career.", "Chased a friend round the foot. Nobody caught anybody. Perfect."]},
